{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974040/extras/df28e2142356a3fdb84fe84201eb9a54.poster.avif?t=1756317581\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974040/extras/df28e2142356a3fdb84fe84201eb9a54.webm?t=1756317581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974040/extras/df28e2142356a3fdb84fe84201eb9a54.mp4?t=1756317581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CRACKED\u00a0Demo\u00a0</strong>\u00a0gives you a glimpse into the gameplay of <strong>CRACKED\u00a0</strong>\u00a0which is a fast-paced, 3D PvP roguelike where glass-headed mages go head-to-head (or head-to-shards) in chaotic arena duels. Inspired by <i>Rounds</i> and powered by physics-based combat, every fight is unpredictable, explosive, and wildly replayable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo gives you full access to all features except level editing, only limiting on content. There are 3 maps, 33 upgrades of various rarities and near infinite build possibilities and fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or team up in 1v1, 2v1, or 2v2 showdowns. After every round, choose from a pool of powerful, quirky upgrades that stack into outrageous builds \u2014 from homing fireballs and knockback shockwaves to rapid-fire chaos or debilitating hexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two fights are the same. No glass head survives forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974040/extras/b25b4f04572ec3c59019c7ae903f5220.poster.avif?t=1756317581\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974040/extras/b25b4f04572ec3c59019c7ae903f5220.webm?t=1756317581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974040/extras/b25b4f04572ec3c59019c7ae903f5220.mp4?t=1756317581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2e <strong>Team-based Brawling:</strong> Battle it out in 1v1, 2v1, or 2v2 matches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Glass Heads Will Roll:</strong> Shatter your enemies in intense physics-driven wizard fights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddea <strong>Build Your Madness:</strong> Stack upgrades each round and create broken, over-the-top combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <strong>Fast &amp; Fluid Rounds:</strong> Jump into short, explosive matches with zero downtime.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Controller &amp; Online Ready:</strong> Built for online competitive fun.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974040/extras/d0dcad2a4e2d01d0274fed5f17c1f7a2.poster.avif?t=1756317581\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974040/extras/d0dcad2a4e2d01d0274fed5f17c1f7a2.webm?t=1756317581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974040/extras/d0dcad2a4e2d01d0274fed5f17c1f7a2.mp4?t=1756317581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3974040?t=1756317581","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974040/3807d7370c8c8f4686765a5b3a4c3d6af